{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香濃帶酒香!網民:可移動嘅提拉米蘇</p><p>觀塘咖啡小店新推Tiramisu Latte</p><p>觀塘主打外賣的咖啡小店 Cloudy Ground Coffee，以價錢親民的咖啡聞名。最近新推出一款話題咖啡飲品——Tiramisu Latte$40(L)，入口先是幼滑奶香與咖啡的微苦，中段帶出淡淡酒香，有輕盈甜味的層次感，味道好特別。</p><p>咖啡＋烘焙包點套餐$38</p><p>店家的飲品價錢親民，齋啡 (Black Coffee) 只需$25起，白咖 (White Coffee) $28起，而且凍熱同價。另外$38仲可以自選一款黑/白咖啡，以及一款烘焙包點，包括牛角包、雙重朱古力鬆餅、法式朱古力酥和酸種貝果，好抵！</p><p>Cloudy Ground Coffee</p><p>📍觀塘成業街7號東廣場G19 📍九龍灣淘大商場2樓S151A 官方IG：@cloudygroundcoffee</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884721701583014_7817829786a9fa4730d44c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17888472220475935_9516091056a9fa4768930f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884722415270120_3134145196a9fa478dd835.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884722616515082_10837888516a9fa47a90d3b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884722784649610_16244705606a9fa47c9f1d2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884723026198491_19426636626a9fa48113c15.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884723674735908_15663677526a9fa485403d6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T06:04:07.207041+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":446,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}